{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Don\u2019t Peek&quot; is a cooperative horror game you can play with friends or alone. Your goal is to survive at all costs or defeat evil using weapons and ingenuity. Immerse yourself in an atmosphere of fear and tension, where every step might be your last. Modes include escaping a maniac or hunting ghosts. Use limited weapons, solve puzzles, hide from enemies, or risk fighting. The game supports voice and text chat, and enemies react to sound\u2014including what you say, walk, and breathe. Speak \u2014 be ready to be heard.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/dontpeek.png?t=1747732436\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634220?t=1747732436","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/740eb9cdae76c1fbe3294d678e7c739e06839cea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747732436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/73495611b3c202199f11eb13ec32b04639f53fff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747732436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/73495611b3c202199f11eb13ec32b04639f53fff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747732436","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Don\u2019t Peek&quot; is a cooperative horror game you can play with friends or alone. Your goal is to survive at all costs or defeat evil using weapons and ingenuity. Immerse yourself in an atmosphere of fear and tension, where every step might be 